    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d7847d43a0e044e187e5e28fbe4d2fa3",
      "statement": "F1 is the harmonic mean 2PR/(P+R) of precision_at_k and recall, and is 0 when both are zero; it does not use the recall_at_k values.",
